; NO icon_override in SP1. SP5 gives this Kit the ALL SYSTEMS RED glyph: design section 5 asks for
; exactly two families on this core system, and the RAGE family is worn by action_rage and
; action_combust (Tasks 6 and 10). ALL SYSTEMS RED cannot wear a glyph of its own - its action
; overrides show_in_tooltip to false, so ICON_TARGETS refuses to list it - so the KIT's own glyph IS
; that family. (The Sluagh's frame close found the same thing about Astral Guardian.)
